0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 158.6 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 14 TL (NutriLink AI is a research prototype designed to support the discovery and preliminary formulation of) Tj T* (alternative-protein ingredients relevant to Nigeria and the wider West African region. The prototype combines) Tj T* (nutritional composition records from the FAO/INFOODS uPulses 1.0 database and the FAO/INFOODS Food) Tj T* (Composition Table for Western Africa \(2019\). A harmonised dataset of 68 ingredient records was assembled,) Tj T* (including a seven-ingredient shortlist for formulation demonstrations. The workflow includes data cleaning,) Tj T* (exploratory analysis, protein-based ingredient ranking, comparison of regression algorithms, feature-importance) Tj T* (analysis, a weighted ingredient recommendation score and a constrained mathematical optimizer. The optimizer) Tj T* (generated 100 g formulations for protein targets of 20 g, 23 g and 25 g; all passed the implemented weight,) Tj T* (protein-target and maximum-inclusion checks. The work demonstrates a functional research prototype, but not a) Tj T* (commercially validated food-formulation system. The dataset is small, functional-property and cost information) Tj T* (are incomplete, allergen controls are not implemented, and laboratory, food-safety, digestibility and sensory) Tj T* (testing have not been conducted.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
